sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as 平台管理员
    participant Controller as SystemController
    participant Service as SystemService
    participant Dao as SystemDao
    participant DTO as categoryDTO

    Note over Admin, DTO: 职位分类管理

    %% 职位分类管理
    Admin->>Controller: 进入"职位分类管理"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: getCategoryTree()
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询所有职位分类(按层级排序)
    activate Dao
    Note right of Dao: 分类结构:<br/>- 一级分类: 行业大类<br/>- 二级分类: 细分职位<br/>- 三级分类: 具体岗位
    Dao-->>Service: 返回分类列表
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>Service: 构建树形结构
    Service-->>Controller: 返回分类树
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示分类树形表格
    deactivate Controller

    %% 添加分类
    Note over Admin, DTO: 添加分类
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"添加分类"，填写表单
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: addCategory(categoryDTO)
    activate Service
    Note right of DTO: 包含字段:<br/>- categoryName: 分类名称<br/>- parentId: 父分类ID(0为顶级)<br/>- sortOrder: 排序顺序<br/>- status: 状态(ENABLED/DISABLED)
    Service->>Service: 校验同级分类名称唯一性
    Service->>Dao: 插入新分类记录
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回分类ID
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 添加成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 提示"分类添加成功"<br/>刷新分类树
    deactivate Controller

    %% 编辑分类
    Note over Admin, DTO: 编辑分类
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"编辑"分类
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: updateCategory(categoryId, categoryDTO)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 更新分类信息
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 更新成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 提示"分类已更新"
    deactivate Controller

    %% 删除分类
    Note over Admin, DTO: 删除分类
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"删除"分类
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: deleteCategory(categoryId)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 检查是否有子分类
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 存在子分类
    alt 存在子分类
        Service-->>Controller: 提示"请先删除子分类"
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 错误提示
    else 不存在子分类
        Service->>Dao: 检查是否有职位关联
        Dao-->>Service: 无关联职位
        Service->>Dao: 逻辑删除分类
        Dao-->>Service: 删除成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service-->>Controller: 删除成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 提示"分类已删除"
    end
    deactivate Controller